r, cube sums, etc.), ensure your answer’s content is directly relevant and accurate, but do not include extra explanation or steps unless required by the constraints.\n\nIn all cases, if you detect requirement conflicts or impossibilities (for instance, incompatible format rules), concisely explain the conflict and do not attempt to answer the main question. Double-check your output against the constraints before submitting. If uncertain, explicitly state which instructions you followed, ensuring transparency in how constraints were met.\n```"}}
