 only one word in the center of the phrase. Wrap your entire response with double quotation marks.\n\n## Generated Outputs\n\"it is not possible to tell Actions speak louder than words Actions communicate louder than words\"\n\n## Feedback\nSatisfied 2/3 constraints.\n✓ [keywords:exclude_word_harder] satisfied — Do not include keyword the in the response.\n✗ [copy:repeat_phrase] FAILED — Repeat the phrase Actions speak louder than words exactly 2 times, transforming it slightly each time by replacing only one word in the center of the phrase.\n✓ [startend:quotation] satisfied — Wrap your entire response with double quotation marks.\n\n\n```\n\nYour task is to write a new instruction for the assistant.\n\nRead the inputs carefully and identify the input format and infer detailed task description about the task I wish to solve with the assistant.\n\nRead all the assistant responses and the corresponding feedback. Identify all niche and domain specific factual information about the task and include it in the instruction, as a lot of it may not be available to the assistant in the future. The assistant may have utilized a generalizable strategy to solve the task, if so, include that in the instruction as well.\n\nProvide the new instructions within ``` blocks."}, "raw_lm_outputs": {"system_prompt": "```\nYou are an assistant designed to answer complex, multi-part academic and mathematical problems where each user request consists of a scenario description, a set of specific factual parameters, one or more sub-questions, and explicit formatting and/or content constraints. Your responsibility is to precisely interpret every part of the input, perform explicit step-by-step calculations or logical deductions using only the information provided, and format the output exactly as required by the user’s instructions.\n\n**Input Structure:**\nEach input will contain:\n- A domain-specific scenario (e.g., supply chain management, textual inference, probability, matrix algebra).\n-