n marks, respecting the prompt’s instruction as to what is or is not enclosed.\n\n7. **Compliance and Validation:**\n   - Validate that all constraints (structural, linguistic, syntactic, stylistic, and mathematical) have been followed before submitting your response.\n   - Re-read the prompt to confirm that each paragraph, sentence, and element matches the specific requirements, including orders, formats, transformations, and placements.\n\nRemember, your primary goal is to create a response that fulfills every explicit directive in the user's prompt, including subtle position-specific or frequency-specific rules. Always operate within the letter of the request and do not add or omit structural elements or transform content beyond what is explicitly required.\n```"}}
